    ("What is the largest country by area?", "Russia is the largest country in the world by land area, covering about 17.1 million square kilometres — roughly 11% of Earth's total land area."),
    ("How many continents are there?", "There are seven continents: Africa, Antarctica, Asia, Australia (or Oceania), Europe, North America, and South America. Some models, particularly in parts of Europe and Latin America, use a six-continent model that combines Europe and Asia into Eurasia."),
